    "detailed_description": "Mech Realm - a dystopia in which humans have taken a back seat, and the world is ruled by robots and a chosen group of their creators. Progress has reached a point where humans are no longer needed, as robots have replaced almost all professions. You must decide the fate of the world and choose whether to serve the robots or resist.<br><br><strong>Main features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A unique gaming world with various locations and characters<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/0142f834ad93cfd7a9ab0d2f94df250b.poster.avif?t=1715673032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/0142f834ad93cfd7a9ab0d2f94df250b.webm?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/0142f834ad93cfd7a9ab0d2f94df250b.mp4?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Freedom of choice and exploration of the world of mechs<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/d1c62dd92acda3b25df4c286382f498f.poster.avif?t=1715673032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/d1c62dd92acda3b25df4c286382f498f.webm?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/d1c62dd92acda3b25df4c286382f498f.mp4?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Thrilling shootouts<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/2ff73a34eac47de8517a69b6ff9b971d.poster.avif?t=1715673032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/2ff73a34eac47de8517a69b6ff9b971d.webm?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/2ff73a34eac47de8517a69b6ff9b971d.mp4?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Various weapons, each with its own characteristics<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/124990139e3cd8aa73b6f53b925b5f9b.poster.avif?t=1715673032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/124990139e3cd8aa73b6f53b925b5f9b.webm?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/124990139e3cd8aa73b6f53b925b5f9b.mp4?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Interesting puzzles that can be solved both with wit and strength.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/c5feb727af4d280cbfec24b7c7fbe6f8.poster.avif?t=1715673032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/c5feb727af4d280cbfec24b7c7fbe6f8.webm?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/c5feb727af4d280cbfec24b7c7fbe6f8.mp4?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> A cruel world where there is almost no honor left, everyone only thinks about themselves.<br><br></li><li> In the game, there are not only enemies, but also different rebel groups. By completing their missions, you can gain access to better weapons and ammunition, as well as unlock secret locations on the map.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/f32eeea945879eed459f39b1b7407664.poster.avif?t=1715673032\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/f32eeea945879eed459f39b1b7407664.webm?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2442470/extras/f32eeea945879eed459f39b1b7407664.mp4?t=1715673032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br></li><li> Diverse dialogue system, your choices affect the plot and behavior of enemies and allies.</li></ul>",
